<div class="phead"><div class="wrap"><p class="kick">Testing · Ossel River source</p><h1>Water quality reports</h1><p class="lede">Quarterly snapshots and the annual report, summarized before the table — so a resident can find pH, chlorine and lead/copper results without reading a lab PDF first.</p></div></div><section class="sec"><div class="wrap">{% for i in Target.Items %}{%- assign x=i.PublishedContent -%}<a class="listrow" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ i.RoutePath }}"><div><b>{{ x.report_year }}</b><br>{{ x.period }}</div><div><b>{{ i.PrimaryField }}</b><p>{{ x.summary }}</p><p><b>Key:</b> {{ x.key_results }}</p></div><div><img src="{{ x.image.Value | attachment_redirect_url }}" alt=""></div></a>{% endfor %}</div></section>
